  "implementationWarnings": [
    "Do not add automatic Attribute/Ability bonus dots just because a Clan description recommends a priority. Those are character-creation suggestions, not bonuses.",
    "Nosferatu Appearance 0 is a genuine mechanical override and an exception to the normal Attribute base of 1.",
    "Keep V20 Core optional 'More Inhuman Vampires' (4 Disciplines / 0 Backgrounds) distinct from the project's Sabbat profile (4 Disciplines / 5 Virtues / 5 Backgrounds).",
    "Use freebie cost Humanity/Path = 2 in the V20 Core RuleSet; the older project spec value 1 should be corrected or versioned as a house rule.",
    "Do not infer Sect permanently from Clan; store clanId and sectId separately.",
    "Do not treat 'signature Discipline' as globally exclusive; bloodlines/variants may share it."
  ]
